(5888849, 857937, 113419, '<td valign="top">Yes, they are everywhere - and as I was looking for something to shoot for this challenge I thought the same thing; but I think that for this challenge the viewer needs more direction on what they are seeing.  Is this a "front yard" or a "home challenge"?  I would just like defination.  Besides that, I think I would have included more of the left side of the house in the photo as the it would show where the drive was leading to or perhaps cropped out the street.</td>', 'Yes, they are everywhere - and as I was looking for something to shoot for this challenge I thought the same thing; but I think that for this challenge the viewer needs more direction on what they are seeing.  Is this a "front yard" or a "home challenge"?  I would just like defination.  Besides that, I think I would have included more of the left side of the house in the photo as the it would show where the drive was leading to or perhaps cropped out the street.', '2010-03-03 14:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
