(5891205, 858053, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and the viewpoint is real cool. But it is just underexposed a few stops. I think it was done intentionally, but I don''t think it is working too well. One think I do like is the sun flare. It''s awesome.</td>', 'This is a great shot and the viewpoint is real cool. But it is just underexposed a few stops. I think it was done intentionally, but I don''t think it is working too well. One think I do like is the sun flare. It''s awesome.', '2010-03-05 08:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
