(5891222, 858130, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of parallel lines. In order to make it stronger, I would try to reframe this to leave out the sky and the residential housing on the right and just show the lines.</td>', 'This is a great example of parallel lines. In order to make it stronger, I would try to reframe this to leave out the sky and the residential housing on the right and just show the lines.', '2010-03-05 08:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
