(5891230, 857948, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great idea but I would have preferred to see less focus on the tiger. My attention should be drawn to the fence and that should be crisp and well lit. Contrast and lighting very dull.</td>', 'Great idea but I would have preferred to see less focus on the tiger. My attention should be drawn to the fence and that should be crisp and well lit. Contrast and lighting very dull.', '2010-03-05 08:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891241, 858082, 10785, '<td valign="top">Where''s the swimmers? Where''s the action? The shot is pretty good for parallel lines, but it''s lacking the excitement that could make it a great shot! You could probably try to reframe it to lose the building and the pool deck on the left to make it stronger as a static image.</td>', 'Where''s the swimmers? Where''s the action? The shot is pretty good for parallel lines, but it''s lacking the excitement that could make it a great shot! You could probably try to reframe it to lose the building and the pool deck on the left to make it stronger as a static image.', '2010-03-05 08:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
