(5897512, 857728, 68163, '<td valign="top">soo many lines!!! This images works on so many levels. It''s a little busy, but I love the highkey feel w/ the darker tones leading you back.</td>', 'soo many lines!!! This images works on so many levels. It''s a little busy, but I love the highkey feel w/ the darker tones leading you back.', '2010-03-09 22:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897514, 857094, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I especially like how the parallel lines in your picture are illuminated by the sun, while most of the picture remains darker. 7</td>', 'Very nice. I especially like how the parallel lines in your picture are illuminated by the sun, while most of the picture remains darker. 7', '2010-03-09 22:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897515, 857772, 68163, '<td valign="top">I love this image, the birds, the mother and child and the fog raising from the sea. I would however crop it @ the 230pixles on the left to get rid of the distracting pipes.</td>', 'I love this image, the birds, the mother and child and the fog raising from the sea. I would however crop it @ the 230pixles on the left to get rid of the distracting pipes.', '2010-03-09 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897516, 858096, 115307, '<td valign="top">Too hazy for my taste</td>', 'Too hazy for my taste', '2010-03-09 22:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897519, 857950, 115307, '<td valign="top">The emphasis is more on circles than straight lines. This detracts for me. The DoF is nice though. 4</td>', 'The emphasis is more on circles than straight lines. This detracts for me. The DoF is nice though. 4', '2010-03-09 23:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897526, 858082, 115307, '<td valign="top">There are certainly parallel lines. However, it does not appear to be a difficult shot at all, so one could expect a higher quality photo with a more interesting composition. I''ll give it the score it is titled after. 4</td>', 'There are certainly parallel lines. However, it does not appear to be a difficult shot at all, so one could expect a higher quality photo with a more interesting composition. I''ll give it the score it is titled after. 4', '2010-03-09 23:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897527, 858130, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 7</td>', 'Very nice. 7', '2010-03-09 23:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897530, 857925, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am surprised how much I actually like this photo. You made a mundane object interesting. Congrats.</td>', 'I am surprised how much I actually like this photo. You made a mundane object interesting. Congrats.', '2010-03-09 23:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897535, 858000, 115307, '<td valign="top">The glare through the trees really distracts in this photo. The parallel lines are also made less effective by the two people sitting on them. 4</td>', 'The glare through the trees really distracts in this photo. The parallel lines are also made less effective by the two people sitting on them. 4', '2010-03-09 23:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897543, 858217, 115307, '<td valign="top">Too bad you entered this in the Parallel Lines challenge. I think it would have done better in the Shadow Challenge. Of course, no way you could have known....</td>', 'Too bad you entered this in the Parallel Lines challenge. I think it would have done better in the Shadow Challenge. Of course, no way you could have known....', '2010-03-09 23:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897544, 857541, 115307, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love the fog. 9</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love the fog. 9', '2010-03-09 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897548, 858039, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Finally something unique. You have taken the same boring architecture that everyone else is using and made it interesting. 7</td>', 'Very cool. Finally something unique. You have taken the same boring architecture that everyone else is using and made it interesting. 7', '2010-03-09 23:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897574, 856382, 83313, '<td valign="top">I first thought this was tilted, but then I looked at the tall silos and realized it is straight and the ground is actually loping.</td>', 'I first thought this was tilted, but then I looked at the tall silos and realized it is straight and the ground is actually loping.', '2010-03-09 23:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897578, 856665, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting view of a common subject. Shows a good eye for seeing light and angles.</td>', 'Interesting view of a common subject. Shows a good eye for seeing light and angles.', '2010-03-09 23:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897585, 858179, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little too much JPG compression is bringing down this otherwise nice scene. 116k is not excessively tiny, but for such a detailed image it is squishing it down a bit too much.  One can see some compression artifacts around the high contrast edges of the lighthouse, and there is an overall lack of detail and clarity to the rest of the image. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.</td>', 'A little too much JPG compression is bringing down this otherwise nice scene. 116k is not excessively tiny, but for such a detailed image it is squishing it down a bit too much.  One can see some compression artifacts around the high contrast edges of the lighthouse, and there is an overall lack of detail and clarity to the rest of the image. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.', '2010-03-09 23:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897587, 857898, 115436, '<td valign="top">Lovely!<br/>The lights and darks play so nicely with each other.  The tilt works well and to your advantage also (and I''m liking the border) :)</td>', 'Lovely!The lights and darks play so nicely with each other.  The tilt works well and to your advantage also (and I''m liking the border) :)', '2010-03-09 23:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897591, 858089, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just a snapshot under the stairs. I do think that some adjustments could bring out some interesting detail in the textures. Not too much can be done for the overly bright highlights outside, however. Such a wide range of bright and dark is difficult to capture for any camera.</td>', 'Just a snapshot under the stairs. I do think that some adjustments could bring out some interesting detail in the textures. Not too much can be done for the overly bright highlights outside, however. Such a wide range of bright and dark is difficult to capture for any camera.', '2010-03-09 23:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897606, 857772, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love this scene and want to give it a very high vote, but I can''t. There is an excessive amount of JPEG compression that is hurting the detail and clarity of this image. I can see obvious comrpession artifacts around some of the seagulls. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits. <br/> <br/>Still gets a vote on the positive side of the scale. Despite that major technical "oops", it''s a wonderful image and I should reward you with a good vote for what you did accomplish with it.</td>', 'I love this scene and want to give it a very high vote, but I can''t. There is an excessive amount of JPEG compression that is hurting the detail and clarity of this image. I can see obvious comrpession artifacts around some of the seagulls. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.  Still gets a vote on the positive side of the scale. Despite that major technical "oops", it''s a wonderful image and I should reward you with a good vote for what you did accomplish with it.', '2010-03-09 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897610, 856616, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a lack of sharpness to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 24k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.</td>', 'There is a lack of sharpness to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 24k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.', '2010-03-09 23:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897612, 858126, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pow! Like it.</td>', 'Pow! Like it.', '2010-03-09 23:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897616, 856981, 83313, '<td valign="top">I suspect you might be getting blasted for this being overprocessed, but I think the treatment works for this scene. Looks like a watercolor painting.</td>', 'I suspect you might be getting blasted for this being overprocessed, but I think the treatment works for this scene. Looks like a watercolor painting.', '2010-03-09 23:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897622, 857900, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice semi-abstract.</td>', 'Very nice semi-abstract.', '2010-03-09 23:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897632, 857946, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, but a nitpick, if I could. I think the tilt either needs to be straightened, or it should be tilted more, for an intentional effect. As it is now, it just appears you shot the photo tilted and didn''t bother correcting it.</td>', 'I like this, but a nitpick, if I could. I think the tilt either needs to be straightened, or it should be tilted more, for an intentional effect. As it is now, it just appears you shot the photo tilted and didn''t bother correcting it.', '2010-03-09 23:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897634, 857898, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the title! The pic gets a nice high vote as well.</td>', 'Love the title! The pic gets a nice high vote as well.', '2010-03-09 23:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897639, 857503, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Looks a touch flat, though. Not sure if that is intentional on your part or not. If not, some modest levels and contrast adjustments could give it some pop. Again, this may be an intentional effect, so feel welcome to whack me with a cluebat if I am wrong.</td>', 'Very nice. Looks a touch flat, though. Not sure if that is intentional on your part or not. If not, some modest levels and contrast adjustments could give it some pop. Again, this may be an intentional effect, so feel welcome to whack me with a cluebat if I am wrong.', '2010-03-09 23:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
