(5897790, 857900, 83313, '<td valign="top">Abstract is not generally appreciated on DPC outisde of "abstract friendly" topics. Don''t let that keep you from doing such images if those are what you like. There is a smaller group that does like such images. Look at the commenters average and the voting breakdown. A lot of haters, but 47 people also thought it was worth a vote on the positive side of the scale.</td>', 'Abstract is not generally appreciated on DPC outisde of "abstract friendly" topics. Don''t let that keep you from doing such images if those are what you like. There is a smaller group that does like such images. Look at the commenters average and the voting breakdown. A lot of haters, but 47 people also thought it was worth a vote on the positive side of the scale.', '2010-03-10 00:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
