(5899122, 857541, 113884, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bmartuch:</b></div><hr/><i> 3.1417 The power of Pi. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>huh?</td>', 'Originally posted by bmartuch: 3.1417 The power of Pi.   huh?', '2010-03-10 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5899136, 857947, 109341, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bmartuch:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice image. I''m surprised by the score. Thought this should have done much better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you very much for the kind comment.  To be honest, I thought it was going to break a 6 as well.  In fact it was over a 6 just a few hours before the end of the challenge, but looks like I really dissapointed some voters late in the game with 2,3, and 4 votes rushing in :)  There is always a next time!</td>', 'Originally posted by bmartuch: Very nice image. I''m surprised by the score. Thought this should have done much better.   Thank you very much for the kind comment.  To be honest, I thought it was going to break a 6 as well.  In fact it was over a 6 just a few hours before the end of the challenge, but looks like I really dissapointed some voters late in the game with 2,3, and 4 votes rushing in :)  There is always a next time!', '2010-03-10 19:26:54.000000', NULL, 0),
