(5902336, 857521, 3084, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I know this building well as I have had antennas installed on the rooftop, yet I have never stood outside and just looked up.  I will next time I am in London.  You should share it with the Sifton family who own this building, they may buy your print.</td>', 'Nice shot, I know this building well as I have had antennas installed on the rooftop, yet I have never stood outside and just looked up.  I will next time I am in London.  You should share it with the Sifton family who own this building, they may buy your print.', '2010-03-13 08:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
